+/* a human row a chat token sent: the token's name as a chip after the human's (round 17) */
+.msg .who .chip.tok { display: inline-block; min-width: 0; max-width: 24ch; overflow: hidden; height: 18px; line-height: 16px; text-overflow: ellipsis; align-self: center; }
+.msg .who time { flex: none; }
+/* the Tokens section (round 17): the shown-once block opens under the new
+   token's row, which carries C14's cyan rule, and the answer lands on it;
+   a lamp before each name, lit while a used token lives; the form as
+   label-beside-field rows */
